# Export in your shell; the CLI does not auto-load this file.
MODEL_ID=glm5.3-flash
# Set ONE of the following, replacing the example URL with your deployment:
# MODEL_ENDPOINT=https://model.example/v1/chat/completion
# MODEL_BASE_URL=https://model.example/v1
# MODEL_API_KEY=                 # Bearer token, from your credential store/shell
# live configures AGENT_OPT_MODEL=compatible/<MODEL_ID> and the container provider.
# Provider credentials belong only in environment or your Harness credential store.
# Optional network settings; omit these for direct/public-network operation.
# HTTP_PROXY=http://proxy.example:3128
# HTTPS_PROXY=http://proxy.example:3128
# NO_PROXY=localhost,127.0.0.1,::1,.example.internal
# Full PEM trust bundle (public roots + additional CA certificates; no private key).
# AGENT_OPT_CA_BUNDLE=/etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
# scripts/dev.py uses this Ubuntu system bundle by default; explicit setting wins.
# Lowercase proxy variables take precedence, even when explicitly empty.
# See docs/network.md for bootstrap, Docker builds and runtime propagation.
